    "summary": "As the name might suggest, Hollow Knight Multiplayer (HKMP) is a multiplayer mod for the popular 2D action-adventure game Hollow Knight. The main purpose of this mod is to allow people to host games and let others join them in their adventures. There is a dedicated Discord server for the mod where you can ask questions or generally talk about the mod.",
